&#x017F;ucht;<lb/>
<pb n="121" facs="#f0129"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Ein Schau&#x017F;piel</hi>.</fw><lb/>
Mein er&#x017F;ter Blick hinab in un&#x017F;re Gärten<lb/>
