<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <div n="3"><head><hi rendition="#g">Dritter Auftritt</hi>.</head><lb/>
<sp who="#TAS"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Ta&#x017F;&#x017F;o</hi></speaker> <stage>allein.</stage><lb/>
<p>So halte fe&#x017F;t, mein Herz, &#x017F;o war es recht!<lb/>
